  "details": "The current VRChat website provides a system allowing objectors to withdraw counter-notifications they have submitted.\n\nHowever, DMCA claimants do not receive any notification, such as an email, informing them that a counter-notification has been withdrawn.\n\nConsequently, rights holders may proceed with countermeasures unaware that the counter-notification has been withdrawn.\n\nThis may result in significant costs and lead to losses.\n\nThis issue was reported to the VRChat Copyright Team via email several months ago but remains unaddressed.",
